   "latex": "$$\\int_1^2 \\left(x + \\frac{3}{x}\\right)dx = \\left[\\frac{x^2}{2} + 3\\ln|x|\\right]_1^2$$\n$$= \\left(\\frac{2^2}{2} + 3\\ln 2\\right) - \\left(\\frac{1^2}{2} + 3\\ln 1\\right)$$\n$$= 2 + 3\\ln 2 - \\left(\\frac{1}{2} + 0\\right) = \\frac{3}{2} + 3\\ln 2$$",
   "marks_breakdown": null,
