  {
   "question": "7(b)",
   "part": "b",
   "latex": "$h = \\dfrac{b-a}{n} = \\dfrac{5-0}{4} = 1.25$\n\n$$\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c|c|c} x & 0 & 1.25 & 2.5 & 3.75 & 5 \\\\ \\hline f(x) & 1 & \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2.25}} & \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3.5}} & \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{4.75}} & \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} \\end{array}$$\n$$\\approx \\frac{h}{2}\\Big[f(0) + f(5) + 2\\{f(1.25) + f(2.5) + f(3.75)\\}\\Big]$$\n$$\\approx \\frac{1.25}{2}\\left[1 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} + 2\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2.25}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3.5}} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4.75}}\\right\\}\\right]$$\n$$\\approx 2.96$$",
